description:
Independent nondurable run journal for contract tests and embedded experiments.

This backend never opens SQLite. It intentionally retains full detached versions;
production `memory` mode continues to use the bounded durable SQLite journal.

Transactional live stores and an append-only, exact-time SQLite ledger.

Payloads use canonical JSON, never pickle.  Connections belong to a single run;
an RLock serializes writes and permits detached reads from application threads.
